/workspace/A111/runs/future/versioned_preset_catalog/research/worker/source_snapshots/mdn_dialog.txt:645:The <dialog> HTML element represents a modal or non-modal dialog box or other interactive component, such as a dismissible alert, inspector, or subwindow.
